Package: databoard
Title: Automated Content Coding with Large Language Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Katharina", "Maubach", email = "k.maubach@uni-muenster.de", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Jakob", "Juenger", email = "jakob.juenger@uni-muenster.de", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Provides an R interface to the Databoard service of the
    Digital Media and Computational Methods research unit at the university of Münster.
    Databoard uses large language models to automatically summarise,
    code, and annotate text. The package handles authentication, task
    submission, progress tracking, and retrieval of results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://databoard.uni-muenster.de/
BugReports: https://github.com/datavana/databoard_r/issues
